data.format:
One JPG scan per page, 2479×3508 px (A4 at 300 dpi) and 0.7–1.9 MB each. The ground truth is one JSON file per page, following the `MagazinePage` dataclass in `dataclass.py`, with one `[x0, y0, x1, y1]` box per advertisement in original-image pixel coordinates, (x0, y0) the top-left and (x1, y1) the bottom-right corner:

```json
{
  "advertisements": [
    {"box": [265, 1730, 2344, 3235]},
    {"box": [300, 187, 2331, 1703]}
  ]
}
```

The 46 pages hold 126 advertisements, between 1 and 7 per page.
